  parchment to Yendar Starpyre and we were ready. Once Renux appeared we engaged 
  in battle and soon afterwards Renux was down.<br>
  <br>
  Congradulations Akashia! <br>
  <br>
  Today was very productive. Thanks everyone for making Legerdemain such a great 
  guild!<br>
  <br>
